{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00617",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.28,
      "end_seconds": 10.92,
      "duration_seconds": 9.64,
      "text": "Hi, sorry, I probably shouldn't have come in, it's nothing, my heart just did a thing at work."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 12.19,
      "end_seconds": 22.51,
      "duration_seconds": 10.32,
      "text": "He's the one who got the manager to call a cab, doctor. Tell her what you told me. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.77,
      "end_seconds": 30.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "Come on in, take a seat. What did your heart do?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.69,
      "end_seconds": 43.81,
      "duration_seconds": 11.12,
      "text": "It started racing, thumping really, and I felt kind of light-headed. I thought I was about to go down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.21,
      "end_seconds": 48.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "And how long did that last?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.05,
      "end_seconds": 57.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "Maybe ten minutes? Honestly I wasn't looking at a clock, I was gripping the printer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.97,
      "end_seconds": 62.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Has it ever happened before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.39,
      "end_seconds": 76.79,
      "duration_seconds": 11.4,
      "text": "Hmm. I think so, a while back, but I can't tell you when. Might've been last spring, might've been the winter before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 78.17,
      "end_seconds": 89.47,
      "duration_seconds": 11.3,
      "text": "I took a note of how long he was sitting out there. About forty minutes, and he was fine the whole time. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.88,
      "end_seconds": 97.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Good to know, thank you. Is it still going on now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.92,
      "end_seconds": 108.63,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "No, it settled while I was waiting. I just feel a bit wrung out, you know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.11,
      "end_seconds": 118.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "That's understandable. Anything else going on with you lately, big stress, not much sleep? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.69,
      "end_seconds": 130.55,
      "duration_seconds": 9.86,
      "text": "Work's been crazy since the merger, and I've been living on coffee to keep up. I know, I know. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.94,
      "end_seconds": 141.97,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "That's probably not helping you. It's worth cutting down, and I'll tell you why in a second. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.05,
      "end_seconds": 150.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "I figured you'd say that. Is my heart okay? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.65,
      "end_seconds": 164.8,
      "duration_seconds": 12.15,
      "text": "What you describe sounds like it settled by itself, and that's reassuring. I don't want to over-read a single episode, though. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.04,
      "end_seconds": 168.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "So what happens now? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.06,
      "end_seconds": 183.81,
      "duration_seconds": 13.75,
      "text": "Honestly, today is mostly advice. Cut the coffee down to one or two a day, and drink water at your desk, especially when you're busy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 186.65,
      "end_seconds": 195.41,
      "duration_seconds": 8.76,
      "text": "I can give you a leaflet on what to do if it happens again. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.54,
      "end_seconds": 203.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "That'd be great. I'm terrible at remembering things when I'm panicking. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.61,
      "end_seconds": 216.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "The leaflet will say it simply. If it comes back, sit down, breathe slowly, and time it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.62,
      "end_seconds": 223.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "Sit and time it. Okay. What if it doesn't stop? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.43,
      "end_seconds": 239.14,
      "duration_seconds": 13.71,
      "text": "If it lasts more than twenty minutes, or you get chest pain, or you actually faint, call for an ambulance. Don't drive yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.24,
      "end_seconds": 246.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Right. Okay. I think I've got it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 249.33,
      "end_seconds": 260.42,
      "duration_seconds": 11.09,
      "text": "I'll go and fetch that leaflet now, and I'll find you some water while I'm at it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.33,
      "end_seconds": 269.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "Thank you both. Sorry again for taking up your time. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.49,
      "end_seconds": 279.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "You haven't, and you were right to come. Look after yourself. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 281.69,
      "end_seconds": 284.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Back in a minute. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.8,
      "end_seconds": 290.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Take care, doctor. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.43,
      "end_seconds": 295.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "And you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.2,
      "end_seconds": 301.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Right, back to the printer. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.13,
      "end_seconds": 305.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Maybe sit down first. ~"
    }
  ]
}
